  "Question": "In parallelogram \\(ABCD\\), \\(AB=x+2\\) and \\(AD=2x-3\\) (unit: cm). If parallelogram \\(ABCD\\) is a rhombus, find its side length. (Unit: cm.)",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "7",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Adjacent sides of a rhombus are equal, so \\(x+2=2x-3\\), giving \\(x=5\\). The side length is \\(5+2=7\\).",
